WEBVTT

00:05:58.604 --> 00:06:02.525
In some other examples,
AI might take a more creative role.

00:06:02.858 --> 00:06:06.654
It could be an illuminator
where it can take a complex problem

00:06:06.695 --> 00:06:09.615
and come up with potential
solutions to that problem

00:06:09.657 --> 00:06:11.534
and illuminate some options

00:06:11.534 --> 00:06:14.203
that might have been impossible
for humans to see.

00:06:14.703 --> 00:06:16.580
Let me give you another example.

00:06:17.581 --> 00:06:19.375
During the COVID pandemic,

00:06:19.417 --> 00:06:22.128
if you walked into a retail
or grocery store,

00:06:22.169 --> 00:06:25.464
you saw that many retailers
were struggling.

00:06:25.506 --> 00:06:27.007
Their shelves were empty,

00:06:27.049 --> 00:06:29.927
their suppliers were not able
to fulfill the orders,

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:33.055
and with all the uncertainties
of the pandemic,